// Randomness generator file — details for places, in any genre.
// Lines starting with // are comments.
// The FIRST table is what rolls when the file is rolled.
// Loresmith's Place generator rolls each table here by name, along with
// Setting (Setting.rdm) for the kind of place and the genre's Locations.
// Roll from any note with `rdm:[@Place Sketch]`
Title: Places
Use: Setting.rdm

Table: Place Sketch
[@Setting]: [@Place Atmosphere]. You notice [@Place Feature]. Trouble brewing: [@Place Trouble].

